{"seq":3,"slug":"diverse-appraisals","title":"多元的评价","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"admirers-and-critics","title":"崇拜者与批评者","url":"/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/admirers-and-critics","wordCount":1635,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"historical-assessment","title":"历史地位的评判","url":"/c/people/steve-jobs/controversies-and-appraisal/diverse-appraisals/historical-assessment","wordCount":1723,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 多元的评价\n\n对乔布斯的评价从来不是一边倒的。本章呈现围绕他的多元声音，并尝试给出更平衡的历史定位。\n\n第一篇文档讲述\"崇拜者与批评者\"——两种对立的声音如何各自触及他的某一面真实，共同构成理解他的多元图景。第二篇文档讲述\"历史地位的评判\"，在超越一时争议的尺度上，审视他作为信息时代塑造者与商业巨匠的历史席位。\n"}